---
import fs from 'node:fs';
import yaml from 'js-yaml';
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import ClubCard from '../components/ClubCard.astro';
import StatSelectionTime from '../components/StatSelectionTime.astro';
import StatDecade from '../components/StatDecade.astro';

// Parse RPG Club data
const rpgclub = yaml.load(fs.readFileSync('src/data/rpgclub.yml', 'utf8')) as Array<{
  name: string;
  date: {
    select: Date | string;
    release: Date | string;
  };
}>;

const currentCard = rpgclub[0];
const chronicleCards = rpgclub.slice(1);
---

<Layout
  title="RPG Club"
  description="A book club for RPGs where members vote on a game to play each month and share media contributions."
  icon="rpgclub"
>
  <div class="alert alert-info" role="alert">
    <p class="mb-0">
      The RPG Club has concluded its journey, with the current chapter serving as the final selection. This page remains as 
      a historical record of the games we explored together, the discussions we shared, and the community that formed around
      our shared passion for role playing games. The chronicle below preserves the complete timeline of our monthly 
      selections, from the first game to the last, capturing a meaningful period of collaborative gaming and discovery.
    </p>
  </div>

  <hr class="my-4" />

  <p>
    RPG Club is a community event that operates like a club for role playing games (RPGs). Near the end of each month, our
    group nominates and votes on games for future play. The game selected for the current month automatically carries over
    to the next poll, allowing it to be played for multiple months.
  </p>

  <p>
    Throughout the event, participants are encouraged to play and discuss the selected game while sharing their favorite
    related media. Contributions can include fan art, videos, images, romhacks, and game streaming as a way to share
    experiences and strategies with the community.
  </p>

  <p>
    Although participation in these activities is optional, they provide great opportunities to enhance the overall
    experience. Join us to explore a community of RPG enthusiasts who enjoy playing and sharing their passion for this
    genre!
  </p>

  <h3 class="fw-light mt-4">Final Chapter</h3>
  <div class="row row-cols-1 row-cols-md-2 row-cols-lg-3 g-4">
    {currentCard && <ClubCard card={currentCard} />}
  </div>

  <h3 class="fw-light mt-4">Statistics</h3>
  <StatSelectionTime />
  <StatDecade />

  <h3 class="fw-light mt-4">Chronicle</h3>
  <div class="row row-cols-1 row-cols-md-2 row-cols-lg-3 g-4">
    {chronicleCards.map((card) => <ClubCard card={card} />)}
  </div>
</Layout>
